  <section class="paper__section" id="formal-design" data-result-stage="setup" aria-labelledby="experiment-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">3</p>
    <h2 id="experiment-title">{t('实验设置：Qwen3-1.7B × WebShop', 'Experiments: Qwen3-1.7B × WebShop')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '这一节先说明三条实验各自改了什么、哪些条件保持相同。三条已完成实验都使用 Qwen3-1.7B 和 WebShop，Stage 2 都跑 160 轮。真正的正式匹配对照只有 Bounded Online Recurrence 与 Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating（α 固定为 1）：它们每轮 128 个 rollout，并对齐任务、seed、sampling、horizon、replay 和 optimizer recipe。普通 OpenEVO 是更早完成的前序实验；动态 α + 动态 β 还没有运行。',
      'This section first states what each run changes and which conditions are held fixed. All three completed experiments use Qwen3-1.7B and WebShop and run Stage 2 for 160 rounds. The formal matched pair is Bounded Online Recurrence versus Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating (α fixed at 1): both use 128 rollouts per round with matched tasks, seeds, sampling, horizon, replay, and optimizer recipe. Ordinary OpenEVO is an earlier predecessor run; dynamic α + dynamic β has not been run.',
    )}</p>
    <dl class="paper__setup">
      <div><dt>{t('模型', 'Model')}</dt><dd>Qwen3-1.7B</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('环境', 'Environment')}</dt><dd>WebShop</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Stage 2</dt><dd>160 × 128 = 每组 20,480 次任务尝试</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('历史状态', 'History state')}</dt><dd>rank128 Bounded State</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('当前参数更新', 'Current update')}</dt><dd>rank8 SD-LoRA</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('冻结终评', 'Frozen final')}</dt><dd>128 tasks</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p>{t(
      `这批 1.7B OpenEVO 的 Stage 2 起点来自 Stage 1 的 OPSD 参数学习；Qwen3-1.7B 的 Stage 1 OPSD 实际记录为 ${study.posthocAnalysis.stage1.qwen3OneP7bOpsdOptimizerSteps.toLocaleString('en-US')} 个优化器更新步。它不是 SEED 的 hindsight-skill SFT，所以这三组实验本身不能回答“SFT 起点和 OPSD 起点谁更好”。`,
      `The Stage-2 origin for this 1.7B OpenEVO lineage comes from the Stage-1 OPSD parameter bootstrap, which records ${study.posthocAnalysis.stage1.qwen3OneP7bOpsdOptimizerSteps.toLocaleString('en-US')} optimizer steps for Qwen3-1.7B. This is not SEED hindsight-skill SFT, so these three runs do not answer whether SFT or OPSD is the better warm start.`,
    )}</p>
    <pre class="paper__code paper__code--compact"><code>{`SEED 论文路线：trajectory → hindsight skill → SFT
本页 OpenEVO：Stage 1 OPSD 参数学习 → OPSD bootstrap → Stage 2 SD-LoRA / Bounded`}</code></pre>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
      '因此后面把普通 SFT、普通 OPSD 和 SEED 1.7B 复现列为第一优先 baseline，不是重复已有实验：它们是在补当前三条 SD-LoRA 路线共同缺失的训练方法参照。',
      'That is why ordinary SFT, ordinary OPSD, and a SEED 1.7B reproduction are first-priority baselines rather than duplicates of an existing run: they supply the training-method references that all three current SD-LoRA lines lack.',
    )}</p>

    <div id="carrier-ledger">
      <h3>3.1 {t('随着 rollout 积累，参数和非参数状态都会在满足条件时更新', 'As rollouts accumulate, both parametric and non-parametric state can update when their conditions are met')}</h3>
      <p class="paper__lede">{t(
        '每一轮先完成 128 个 rollout。Rollout 结束后，OpenEVO 会同时检查两类东西：模型参数要不要继续学习，以及 Text Memory、Skill Bundle、Agent System 这些非参数经验要不要改。四条通道都有机会把新状态带到下一轮，但更新条件不同；条件不满足，就继续沿用上一轮。',
        'Each round first completes 128 rollouts. OpenEVO then checks two kinds of state in parallel: whether the model parameters should keep learning from this round, and whether the non-parametric Text Memory, Skill Bundle, or Agent System should change. All four channels can carry a new state into the next round, but each has its own update condition; otherwise the previous state is retained.',
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        '这里的四种状态含义不同：参数 State 是真正写进模型权重、跨轮保留的参数变化；Text Memory 是从 rollout 轨迹中总结出的文字经验；Skill Bundle 是被多个任务支持、可以重复使用的做法；Agent System 是适用范围更广的行为规则。后三者叫“非参数状态”，只是因为它们不写进模型权重；后续做题时，系统仍可以把已有内容放进模型上下文。',
        'The four state types play different roles. Parameter State is the parameter change written into model weights and carried across rounds. Text Memory is textual experience summarized from rollout trajectories. Skill Bundle stores reusable procedures supported by multiple tasks. Agent System stores broader behavioral rules. The latter three are called non-parametric only because they are not written into model weights; their existing content can still be placed into model context during later tasks.',
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        '一轮可以直接理解成：rollout 产生轨迹 → 从轨迹里提取可验证证据 → 四条状态通道分别检查自己的更新门槛 → 满足条件就写入新状态，不满足就沿用旧状态。仓库原始收据把这两种结果记作 UPDATE 和 NOOP。',
        'A round can be read as: rollouts produce trajectories → verifiable evidence is extracted → each of the four state channels checks its own update gate → a new state is written when the condition is met, otherwise the previous state is retained. The raw repository receipts call these two outcomes UPDATE and NOOP.',
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        '这里不是“让 LM 自己决定要不要更新”。是否有资格产生新候选，先由代码根据当前轮的 grounded evidence 做确定性 gate；只有 eligible=true，reflector 模型才看到一个经过裁剪的证据投影并生成候选。候选随后还要通过结构 / 内容 validator；如果只是格式或输出截断问题，最多做一次同证据 repair。最后通过才 UPDATE，否则保留上一版。',
        'This is not “let the LM decide whether to update.” Eligibility is first determined in code from grounded evidence. Only when eligible=true does the reflector model receive a bounded evidence projection and generate a candidate. The candidate must then pass structural/content validation; a single same-evidence repair is allowed for mechanical or truncation failures. Only an accepted candidate becomes UPDATE; otherwise the prior state is retained.',
      )}</p>
      <pre class="paper__code paper__code--compact"><code>{`grounded rollout evidence
        ↓
deterministic eligibility gate
        ↓ eligible
LM generates candidate from bounded evidence
        ↓
validator
        ↓ mechanical failure only → one repair
accepted → UPDATE     rejected / no better state → KEEP PRIOR`}</code></pre>
      <p class="paper__links">{t('请参考 GitHub：', 'GitHub reference: ')}<a href={study.evidence.carrierReflectorSource} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.carrierReflectorSource} />{t('Carrier reflector / validator 流程', 'Carrier reflector / validator flow')}</a></p>
      <p><strong>{t('参数什么时候变：', 'Parameter update:')}</strong>{t(
        '本轮至少出现 1 条“干净的完整成功”轨迹：任务真正完成，而且没有解析失败、回退路径、修复或无效记录等工程异常。普通 OpenEVO 用这些成功轨迹产生新的 rank8 SD-LoRA 更新；后两组再把当前参数更新写进固定 rank128 State。',
        'At least one clean exact-success trajectory must appear in the round: the task is truly completed without parser, fallback, repair, invalid, or other engineering failures. Ordinary OpenEVO uses these successes to produce a new rank-8 SD-LoRA update; the latter two runs then write the current parameter update into the fixed-rank128 State.',
      )}</p>
      <p><strong>{t('Text Memory 什么时候变：', 'Text Memory update:')}</strong>{t(
        '出现能由轨迹验证、值得总结的新经验，例如干净成功、同一任务不同 rollout 的分数对照，或可验证的重复失败模式；生成的新 Memory 还要通过格式与内容检查。否则继续用上一版。',
        'There must be new trajectory-verifiable experience worth summarizing, such as a clean success, a within-task score contrast across rollouts, or a verifiable repeated failure pattern; the generated Memory must also pass format and content checks. Otherwise the previous version is retained.',
      )}</p>
      <p><strong>{t('Skill Bundle 什么时候变：', 'Skill Bundle update:')}</strong>{t(
        '同一种可复用做法或错误模式至少得到 2 个不同任务的证据支持，而且当前轮仍有对应证据；生成的新 Skill 还要通过合同检查。否则继续用上一版。',
        'The same reusable procedure or failure pattern must be supported by at least two distinct tasks, with corresponding evidence still present in the current round; the generated Skill must also pass its contract. Otherwise the previous version is retained.',
      )}</p>
      <p><strong>{t('Agent System 什么时候变：', 'Agent System update:')}</strong>{t(
        '更全局的行为规则至少需要 3 个不同任务共同支持，而且当前轮仍有对应证据；生成的新 Agent System 还要通过合同检查。否则继续用上一版。',
        'A more global behavioral rule must be supported by at least three distinct tasks, with corresponding evidence still present in the current round; the generated Agent System must also pass its contract. Otherwise the previous version is retained.',
      )}</p>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
        '这里的“2 个任务 / 3 个任务”描述的是这次冻结 evidence builder 实际采用的门槛，不应该读成 OpenEVO 的理论常数。当前实现先在 evidence builder 里形成 eligible / supporting_patterns，再交给 reflector；未来如果要研究不同更新频率，可以把门槛本身作为新的实验变量，但不能在这次封存结果上事后改。',
        'The “2-task / 3-task” thresholds describe the gates used by this frozen evidence builder, not theoretical constants of OpenEVO. The current implementation first constructs eligible / supporting_patterns in the evidence builder and only then invokes the reflector. Future work may treat those thresholds as experimental variables, but they cannot be changed retrospectively for this sealed result.',
      )}</p>
      <p class="paper__links">{t('请参考 GitHub：', 'GitHub reference: ')}<a href={study.evidence.carrierEvidenceGateSource} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.carrierEvidenceGateSource} />{t('Carrier evidence gate', 'Carrier evidence gate')}</a></p>

