            'Final-state ledger across 160 rounds. The table renders raw receipt UPDATE as “update” and NOOP as “retained.” The parameter row for ordinary OpenEVO counts Parametric SD-LoRA terminal receipts; the latter two parameter rows count Bounded parameter-transition terminal receipts. The ordinary OpenEVO counts come from a historical reconciliation of all 160 sealed ROUND_COMPLETE receipts; the latter two come from the sealed Stage-2 resource analysis of the formal study.',
