      <p class="paper__lede">{t(
        '把上面的门槛和 160 轮账本放在一起看，结果就很直观：参数通道几乎每轮都会产生新状态，而 Text Memory、Skill Bundle 和 Agent System 只有在证据达到各自门槛时才改写，所以次数少得多。这里统计的是“内容多久改一次”，不能据此说参数一定比非参数状态更重要。',
        'Putting the update gates next to the 160-round ledger makes the pattern straightforward: the parameter channel produces a new state in almost every round, while Text Memory, Skill Bundle, and Agent System are rewritten only when evidence reaches their respective gates. This measures how often content changes, not which channel contributes most to final capability.',
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        `“沿用上一轮”不等于“后续做题时不用它”。原始运行日志里的 selected=true，可以直接理解成“这一环境 step 把这份已有内容放进模型上下文”。普通 OpenEVO 里，Skill Bundle 虽然只在 R0 更新 1 次，但在 ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.recordedEnvironmentSteps.toLocaleString('en-US')} 个已记录环境 step 中实际放进模型上下文 ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.skillBundle.selected.toLocaleString('en-US')} 次；Text Memory 放进上下文 ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.textMemory.selected.toLocaleString('en-US')} 次，Agent System 放进上下文 ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.agentSystem.selected.toLocaleString('en-US')} 次。所以，“这一轮没有改内容”和“后续 rollout 没有用这份内容”是两件完全不同的事。`,
        `“Retained from the previous round” does not mean “unused later.” In the raw runtime log, selected=true simply means that, for this environment step, the existing carrier content was placed into the model context. In ordinary OpenEVO, Skill Bundle updated only once at R0, yet it entered the model context for ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.skillBundle.selected.toLocaleString('en-US')} of ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.recordedEnvironmentSteps.toLocaleString('en-US')} recorded environment steps; Text Memory was selected ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.textMemory.selected.toLocaleString('en-US')} times and Agent System ${study.carrierAnalysis.ordinary.runtimeReadback.agentSystem.selected.toLocaleString('en-US')} times. So “the content did not change this round” and “later rollouts did not use it” are different claims.`,
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        `后两组也没有把这三类非参数状态关掉。即使某一轮最后沿用了旧内容，系统仍可能运行生成 / 修复流程，检查有没有新的合格候选。封存收据记录到 Bounded 组的 Text Memory / Skill / Agent 分别消耗 ${study.carrierAnalysis.bounded.producerModelCalls.textMemory} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.bounded.producerModelCalls.skillBundle} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.bounded.producerModelCalls.agentSystem} 次模型调用，β-gating 组分别是 ${study.carrierAnalysis.betaGating.producerModelCalls.textMemory} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.betaGating.producerModelCalls.skillBundle} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.betaGating.producerModelCalls.agentSystem} 次。这个数字是在数“为了检查和生成候选用了多少次模型调用”，不是在数“多少个环境 step 把内容放进模型上下文”，所以不能和上面的 step 数直接比较。`,
        `The latter two runs did not disable these non-parametric states either. Even when a round retains the old content, generation or repair may still run to check whether a new valid candidate exists. Sealed receipts record ${study.carrierAnalysis.bounded.producerModelCalls.textMemory} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.bounded.producerModelCalls.skillBundle} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.bounded.producerModelCalls.agentSystem} Text Memory / Skill / Agent producer model calls for Bounded, and ${study.carrierAnalysis.betaGating.producerModelCalls.textMemory} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.betaGating.producerModelCalls.skillBundle} / ${study.carrierAnalysis.betaGating.producerModelCalls.agentSystem} for β-gating. These count model calls used to inspect and generate candidates, not environment steps where the content entered the model context, so the denominators are not compared directly.`,
      )}</p>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
        'Bounded 与 β-gating 两组使用同一套外部状态生成、校验和修复规则（Completion-First Carrier Contract v2）；两组的参数方法不同以后，后续 rollout 也会不同，因此 Memory / Skill / Agent 在第几轮满足更新条件，是自然产生的下游结果。不能为了“控制变量”强行让两组更新次数相同，也不能只凭这张 UPDATE 表把最终分数差归因给某一个载体。',
        'Bounded and β-gating use the same external-carrier generation, validation, and repair rules (Completion-First Carrier Contract v2); once the parameter methods differ, later rollouts can also differ, so the rounds in which Memory / Skill / Agent meet their update conditions are downstream outcomes that can naturally diverge. We should neither force equal update counts as a “control” nor attribute the final score gap to one carrier from this UPDATE table alone.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
