  <section class="paper__section esg__results" id="formal-result" data-result-stage="task-result-detail" aria-labelledby="result-title">
  <p class="paper__section-number">4</p>
  <h2 id="result-title">{t('实验结果：Task Score、成功率与计算代价', 'Results: Task Score, success, and compute')}</h2>
  <p class="paper__lede">{t(
    '先把“模型做题表现怎样”讲清楚，再进入 loss、参数几何和行为诊断。这里依次看 160 轮原始 Task Score、每 20 轮平均、最后 20 轮平均、固定 128 题终评，以及后两组正式匹配对照的训练期成功率。',
    'We first establish task performance before moving into loss, parameter geometry, and behavior diagnostics. The sequence is the raw 160-round Task Score, non-overlapping 20-round means, the last-20 mean, the fixed 128-task final, and the matched training-period success statistics for the latter two runs.',
  )}</p>

  <h3>4.1 {t('Task Score 是什么：每轮任务完成程度的连续得分', 'What is Task Score? A continuous measure of task completion each round')}</h3>
  <p>{t(
    'Task Score 是 WebShop 每轮任务结束后的连续得分平均值 × 100；部分完成也可能拿到部分分。下面先看完整 160 轮，而不是先挑某个末尾窗口。完整成功率是另一项更严格的指标：只有任务真正 won 且 task_score = 1.0 才算完整做对。',
    'Task Score is the mean terminal WebShop task score multiplied by 100; partial completion can receive partial credit. We start with all 160 rounds instead of selecting a late window first. Exact success is a stricter metric and requires the task to be won with task_score = 1.0.',
  )}</p>
  <div class="paper-table-wrap">
    <table class="paper-table">
      <thead><tr><th>{t('指标', 'Metric')}</th><th>{t('它回答什么', 'What it answers')}</th><th>{t('是否属于 Task Score', 'Part of Task Score?')}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
