      `These posterior rank95 medians are the main new question created by the earlier rank128 design: ${study.parameterAnalysis.off.rank95Median} for Bounded and ${study.parameterAnalysis.on.rank95Median} after adding β. The change is highly low-dimensional within each module, making a capacity ablation more urgent than immediately stacking a more complex gate; however, it still does not prove that a rank8 long-term State preserves task performance.`,
