      'This still does not answer a more important within-run question: how do LoRA / Task Vectors differ between periods when the β run is improving and periods when its score declines? The R159 cross-arm cosine only shows that β and Bounded end up moving in different directions; it does not explain the β run’s own transition from rise to plateau to late decline.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
