      'To answer it, a follow-up read-only analysis should segment the trajectory into phases—for example the rising phase, the R120–139 high window, and the R140–159 decline—and jointly compare β distributions, gradients / Adam moments, update cosine / norm, click/search arguments, and task paths. That analysis has not yet been completed, so this page does not treat the R159 direction gap as the mechanism of the score decline.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__metric-label">{t('③ 分析', '③ Analysis')}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
