      'Here entropy measures how spread out the model is across valid action families such as search and click. Higher Shannon entropy means the action distribution is more spread out; lower entropy means behavior is concentrated on fewer action types. This is action-family entropy, not language-model token entropy, because the formal rollouts did not persist per-token logits/logprobs.',
