      'For β-gating (α fixed at 1), action entropy falls substantially and R159 valid actions are more concentrated on click; valid-action rate is 100% for all three methods. The policy itself is becoming more concentrated rather than failing parsing, but this remains co-occurrence rather than evidence that low entropy causes the score drop.',
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
