      '不是 trainer 完全没优化进去，不是单纯把同一方向更新缩小一点，也不是每一步输出突然变得更长，更不是非法动作增加。',
      'the trainer did not simply fail to optimize; the change is not just a slightly smaller update in the same direction; individual steps do not suddenly become longer; and invalid actions do not increase.',
    )}</p>
