</section>

  <section class="paper__section" id="next-question" data-result-stage="next-question" aria-labelledby="next-question-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">6</p>
    <h2 id="next-question-title">{t('现在真正卡在哪里，以及下一步先做什么', 'What is actually blocked now, and what should come next')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '现在最重要的研究判断已经变了：问题不是“还能给 Gated Delta 再加什么机制”，而是先把几个更基础的变量拆开。Bounded 已经证明固定容量有明确工程价值，但能力保持还不够；后验 rank95 又提示 128 可能远大于实际活跃维度；β 组的负结果则说明更复杂的 controller 不能默认带来更好任务表现。',
      'The main research judgment has changed: the question is no longer what extra mechanism can be added to Gated Delta, but how to separate more basic variables first. Bounded has clear engineering value but does not yet fully preserve capability; posterior rank95 suggests 128 may be far above the active dimensionality; and the negative β result shows that a more complex controller cannot be assumed to improve task performance.',
    )}</p>

    <h3>6.1 {t('第一优先：补普通 SFT、普通 OPSD 与 SEED 1.7B 参照', 'Priority 1: add ordinary SFT, ordinary OPSD, and a SEED 1.7B reference')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      '当前三条实验都建立在 OpenEVO 的 SD-LoRA 参数记忆路径上，但还没有同口径回答一个最基础的问题：如果直接把轨迹做普通 SFT，或者用 OPSD 直接更新一套参数，不保留逐轮 SD-LoRA 历史，会做到什么水平？SEED 的 1.7B 原始训练逻辑也需要本地复现，才能知道差距到底来自训练方式、长期记忆形式还是别的变量。',
      'All three current runs live inside the OpenEVO SD-LoRA parameter-memory path, but we still lack the most basic matched answer: what happens if the trajectories are trained with ordinary SFT, or if OPSD directly updates one parameter set without carrying round-by-round SD-LoRA history? A local SEED 1.7B reproduction is also needed to separate training-method effects from long-term-memory design and other variables.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
      '这组基线不是为了“补表格”，而是决定后续复杂参数记忆机制到底在解决一个真实缺口，还是在一个更简单方法已经能解决的问题上继续加结构。',
      'These baselines are not table-filling exercises; they determine whether complex parameter memory addresses a real missing capability or merely adds structure to a problem a simpler training method already solves.',
    )}</p>

    <h3>6.2 {t('第二优先：直接做 rank 8 / 16 / 32 / 64 / 128 容量消融', 'Priority 2: directly ablate rank 8 / 16 / 32 / 64 / 128')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      '这组实验现在有了很明确的理由：第一版 128 是为了保守地切断无限增长；正式实验后又看到 rank95 中位数只有 8 / 7。下一步应该把容量、参数更新成本和任务能力放在同一个对照里，而不是继续从几何指标猜“8 会不会已经够”。',
      'This experiment now has a concrete motivation: 128 was initially chosen conservatively to stop unbounded growth, while the completed runs show median rank95 values of only 8 / 7. The next step is to measure capacity, parameter-update cost, and task capability together rather than guessing from geometry whether 8 is already enough.',
    )}</p>

    <h3>6.3 {t('第三优先：先做最简单的 β scaling baseline', 'Priority 3: test a simple β-scaling baseline first')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      '当前 β controller 会根据 22 项局部状态，为不同 step / module / rank 预测不同写入强度。下一步先退回一个更简单的控制：把当前更新归一化，再统一乘一个固定 scalar β。这样可以把“控制写入幅度本身有没有价值”和“22 项特征 + MLP controller 设计得好不好”拆成两个问题。',
      'The current β controller predicts different write strengths from 22 local features across steps, modules, and ranks. A cleaner next control is to normalize the current update and multiply it by one fixed scalar β. That separates whether write-magnitude control itself is useful from whether the 22-feature MLP controller is well designed.',
    )}</p>

    <h3>6.4 {t('训练轮数也要重新验证：160 轮不应该只由 training loss 决定', 'The training horizon must also be revalidated: training loss alone should not justify 160 rounds')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      'training loss 继续下降只说明训练目标还能被进一步拟合，不能证明 WebShop validation 还在继续变好。后续实验应该预先冻结 validation 指标和 stopping rule，再判断 120 轮甚至更早是否已经足够。',
      'Continued training-loss reduction only shows that the training objective can still be fit; it does not prove that WebShop validation keeps improving. Future studies should freeze a validation metric and stopping rule prospectively, then test whether 120 rounds or an earlier point is already sufficient.',
    )}</p>

    <h3>6.5 {t('动态 α + 动态 β 仍然保留，但不是当前第一优先', 'Dynamic α + dynamic β remains in the method space, but is not the current first priority')}</h3>
    <p>{t(
      '完整 Gated Delta 里，α 控制旧参数 State 保留多少，β 控制当前新更新写入多少。这个动态 α + 动态 β 组合目前确实还没有运行，所以表 1 继续保留这个空位；但在 SFT / OPSD 基线、rank 容量和简单 β 都还没弄清楚之前，直接加动态 α 会同时增加第二个自由度，让负结果更难解释。',
      'In full Gated Delta, alpha controls prior-state retention and beta controls current-write strength. The dynamic α + dynamic β combination genuinely remains unrun, so Table 1 keeps the slot visible; however, adding dynamic alpha before SFT/OPSD baselines, rank capacity, and simple β are understood introduces another degree of freedom and makes negative results harder to interpret.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
      '已经看过的 Final 只用于形成下一轮研究问题，不能反过来修改或重新解释当前封存实验。任何新 α / β 设计都必须作为新的 prospective experiment 冻结。',
      'The completed Final may motivate the next research question, but it cannot be used retroactively to tune or reinterpret the sealed study. Any new α/β design must be frozen prospectively as a new experiment.',
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="paper__section" id="evidence" data-result-stage="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">7</p>
    <h2 id="evidence-title">{t('证据与复现身份：如何确认这些结果来自哪一组实验', 'Evidence and reproducibility identity: how to identify the exact experiments behind these results')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '这一节不再解释实验结果，而是回答复现和审计问题：每条曲线、表格和结论究竟对应哪一个正式实验身份，应该去哪里查原始证据。网页上的易读名称可以调整，但底层实验 ID、封存结果和证据入口必须保持不变。',
      'This section no longer interprets results. It answers the reproducibility and audit question: which exact formal experiment identity each curve, table, and conclusion belongs to, and where the underlying evidence can be checked. Reader-facing names may improve, but the underlying experiment IDs, sealed results, and evidence entry points must remain unchanged.',
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
      '因此，正文把已完成的第三组明确写成“Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating（α 固定为 1）”，不再把它当作完整 GDR；“动态 α + 动态 β”只保留为未做实验。底层正式身份仍原样保留：普通 OpenEVO 对应历史 DirectApply / No-GDR；后两组正式实验标识仍是 BOUNDED_OFF 与 EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_V1。',
      'Accordingly, the completed third run is named explicitly as “Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating (α fixed at 1)” rather than presented as full GDR, while dynamic α + dynamic β remains only an unrun slot. The underlying formal identities remain unchanged: ordinary OpenEVO maps to the historical DirectApply / No-GDR run, and the matched formal identities remain BOUNDED_OFF and EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_V1.',
    )}</p>
    <details class="paper__details paper__experiment-hub" data-experiment-hub>
      <summary>{t('本实验的结果、分析与证据', 'Results, analysis, and evidence for this experiment')}</summary>
      <p data-hub-motivation><strong>{t('为什么做：', 'Why this experiment: ')}</strong>{experiment.motivation[locale]}</p>
      <div class="paper__hub-grid">
        <div data-hub-group="result">
          <h3>{t('结果', 'Result')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubResults.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div data-hub-group="analysis">
          <h3>{t('分析', 'Analysis')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubAnalyses.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div data-hub-group="evidence">
          <h3>{t('证据 / 历史', 'Evidence / history')}</h3>
          <ul>{hubEvidence.map((link) => <li><a href={p(link.href)}>{link.label[locale]}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="paper__details" open>
      <summary>{t('正式结果与同题 Final', 'Formal results and same-panel final')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.finalComparison}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.finalComparison} />{t('三组同题冻结终评 / Bounded Online Recurrence 与 β-gating（α 固定为 1）正式比较', 'three-way same-panel final / formal Bounded Online Recurrence vs β-gating (α fixed at 1) comparison')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.longHorizon}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.longHorizon} />{t('长期统计与 bootstrap', 'long-horizon statistics and bootstrap')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.publicSnapshot}>{t('公开机器可读结果快照', 'public machine-readable snapshot')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.posthocAnalysis.snapshot}>{t('只读后分析快照', 'read-only post-hoc snapshot')}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details class="paper__details">
      <summary>{t('方法实现与资格证据', 'Method implementation and qualification evidence')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.gaugeInvariantPolicy}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.gaugeInvariantPolicy} />gauge-invariant β policy</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.stepTrace}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.stepTrace} />exact per-step trace</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.finalCloseout}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.finalCloseout} />{t('最终收口记录', 'final closeout')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={directApplyHref}>{t('普通 OpenEVO 独立实验页', 'ordinary OpenEVO experiment')}</a></li>
        <li><a href={boundedHref}>{t('Bounded State 早期研究页', 'Bounded State research page')}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </section>
</article>

